.SS "int thumbnail_enqueue (\fBfile_info\fP * fi)"
.PP
enqueue a file for thumbnail-creation, if its format is supported. 
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIfi\fP - file_info for the item we want a thumbnail for 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns:\fP
.RS 4
If we don't know how to thumbnail a file of the given type, NOIR_TYPEMISMATCH is returned. If THUMBNAIL_IMAGES_SMALLER_THAN is set to a non-zero value and the original file's size exceeds that value, NOIR_IGNORED is returned. If an error occurs, NOIR_FAIL is returned. Otherwise, the response of \fBthumbnail_enqueue_do()\fP is returned.
.RE
.PP

.SS "static int thumbnail_enqueue_do (void * t, \fBfile_info\fP * fi, thumbnail_plugin * tp)\fC [inline, static]\fP"
.PP
fetches or creates a new thumbnail. 
.PP
\fBReturns:\fP
.RS 4
If an up-to-date thumbnail is found, NOIR_SUCC is returned and fi->thumbfile holds the name of that thumbnail. Otherwise, NOIR_PARTIAL is returned and the thumbnail is enqueued for generation. If an error occurs, fi->thumbfile is NULL and an error-code is returned. 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fIt\fP - current theme 
.br
\fIfi\fP - current file 
.br
\fItp\fP - what plugin to use to thumbnail this item
.RE
.PP

